10. Let the applicant- Ravi Kumar be released on bail in the aforesaid case on furnishing a personal bond and two sureties each in the like amount to the satisfaction of magistrate/court concerned,
subject to following conditions:-
(i) the applicant shall not tamper with the prosecution evidence;
(ii) the applicant shall not pressurize the prosecution witnesses;
Ravi Kumar vs State Of U.P. Thru. Prin. Secy. Home ... on 8 May, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/151429594/
